# Scientific Evidence

Evidence Level

★★★★☆

Explosive unilateral resistance training improves lower-body power, hip force production and neuromuscular coordination. Although direct studies on cable knee strikes are limited, the biomechanical principles supporting transfer to striking performance are well established.

